     "<div dir=\"ltr\">My application is at <a href=\"http://jeradhoy.shinyapps.io/choropleth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jeradhoy.shinyapps.io/choropleth&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400890136000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3heQXg6Yb9Byfy2I6pc3iZ\">jeradhoy.shinyapps.io/choropleth</a>. Please forgive my horribly messy code. I currently have the map set at a height of 600px. The code snippet for creating the map is in ui.R is<div><br></div><div>ui.R</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\">leafletMap(<span style=\"color:#d12f1b\">&quot;map&quot;</span>, width=<span style=\"color:#d12f1b\">&quot;100%&quot;</span>, height=<span style=\"color:#272ad8\">600</span>,</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(209,47,27)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">    initialTileLayer = </span>&quot;//{s}.<a href=\"http://tile.thunderforest.com/landscape/%7Bz%7D/%7Bx%7D/%7By%7D.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://tile.thunderforest.com/landscape/%257Bz%257D/%257Bx%257D/%257By%257D.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400890136000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3a1iSHLtWbtAYHepbuNjRl\">tile.thunderforest.com/landscape/{z}/{x}/{y}.png</a>&quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\">,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\">    options=list(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\">      center = c(<span style=\"color:#272ad8\">40</span>, <span style=\"color:#272ad8\">-92.85</span>),</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\">      zoom = <span style=\"color:#272ad8\">4</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px;font-siz