ospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"><span>&quot;</span>//{s}.<a href=\"http://tiles.mapbox.com/v3/jcheng.map-5ebohr46/%7Bz%7D/%7Bx%7D/%7By%7D.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://tiles.mapbox.com/v3/jcheng.map-5ebohr46/%257Bz%257D/%257Bx%257D/%257By%257D.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400890141000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2U00Z2qicjtdxoVnVQ8HPQ\">tiles.mapbox.com/v3/jcheng.map-5ebohr46/{z}/{x}/{y}.png</a><span>&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">,</span><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Menlo, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(223,80,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">     initialTileLayerAttribution</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"> HTML(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,80,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"><span>&#39;</span>Maps by &lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://www.mapbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mapbox.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400890141000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LGejPcoGRZUSx-11eTHwe\">http://www.mapbox.com