   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p dir=\"ltr\">height=100% is tricky in HTML. It can be made to work but the parent elements all need to be setup for it by having their heights set to 100% as well. If you look closely at the example you&#39;re working off of, I&#39;m sure you will find some CSS that either does that or sets an absolute height on one of the parents.</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
